  "_comment": [
    "Cross-implementation vectors for the Trust Vault Merkle convention.",
    "Produced by integrity_sdk.vault (Python); verified by contracts/test/VaultMerkle.t.sol",
    "against the SAME StateAnchor.verifyLeaf the protocol uses on-chain.",
    "Convention: keccak256 leaves, parents hashed with the pair sorted ascending, and an odd",
    "node PROMOTED unchanged (never duplicated - duplicating admits a forged extra leaf).",
    "If these two implementations ever disagree, roots would anchor successfully and then",
    "fail every verification: silent, and expensive to discover later."
